OL,3,ASouth Park creators rename show 'South
OL,4,AAmerica' in apparent dig at Trump
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe creators of South Park, the
OL,7,Fanimated TV show, have announced that
OL,8,Fits new series will be named South
OL,9,FAmerica, in an apparent reference to US
OL,10,FPresident Donald Trump's attempts to
OL,11,Frename a lake and a gulf.
OL,13,F"Inspired by the bravery and patriotism
OL,14,Fof Apple and Google, we are changing
OL,15,Fthe name of South Park to SOUTH
OL,16,FAMERICA," creators Matt Stone and Trey
OL,17,FParker wrote in a statement.
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
FL,172,160,200,105,0,100
